1
00:00:02,955 --> 00:00:08,555
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:08,565 --> 00:00:10,795
(Leonard:)Did you at least have
a good flight down there?

3
00:00:10,801 --> 00:00:12,101
(Sheldon:)It was fine.

4
00:00:12,102 --> 00:00:14,302
(Sheldon:)Other than the weird-tasting
juice Amy gave me.

5
00:00:14,304 --> 00:00:17,004
(Sheldon:)I slept the whole way.

6
00:00:17,007 --> 00:00:20,147
(Penny:)So, what happened in Texas
that was so bad?

7
00:00:20,144 --> 00:00:21,574
(Leonard:)And before our next
drive to Comic-Con,

8
00:00:21,578 --> 00:00:23,708
(Leonard:)I need the name of that juice.

9
00:00:23,714 --> 00:00:27,484
(Sheldon:)Well, we were on our way
to my mother's house...

10
00:00:29,653 --> 00:00:33,293
(Sheldon:)How did we get in the car?

11
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,060
Hold on.

12
00:00:35,826 --> 00:00:37,526
How did you get him
in the car?

13
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:39,158
(Amy:)I rented one of those carts,

14
00:00:39,163 --> 00:00:41,433
(Amy:)pushed him toward the open
door and just let inertia

15
00:00:41,432 --> 00:00:43,962
(Amy:)take care of the rest.

16
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:48,600
(Amy:)So, while we're at
your mother's house,

17
00:00:48,605 --> 00:00:52,405
(Amy:)it might be a good time to tell
her that we're living together.

18
00:00:52,409 --> 00:00:53,939
(Sheldon:)Do we have to?

19
00:00:53,944 --> 00:00:57,184
(Sheldon:)I really don't want
to hear the religious lecture.

20
00:00:57,181 --> 00:00:59,351
(Amy:)Maybe there won't be one.

21
00:00:59,349 --> 00:01:01,679
(Sheldon:)There's always one.

